  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/11/IMG_8407.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(30 fotos) El Chaplin Caf&eacute;, de la calle Ros d&#39;Orsins esquina Falcons,en Onda, ha acogido este jueves una desgustaci&oacute;n de quesos a cargo de Quesomentero Cheesbar, de Vila-real, dentro del Novembre Gastron&ograve;mic. Tambi&eacute;n se sorteaba un &#39;cubomentero&#39;, que ha correspondido a Antonio Gonz&aacute;lez Bud&iacute;.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quesomenterochaplincafenovembregastronomic/img_8379.jpg\" alt=\"img_8379\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quesomenterochaplincafenovembregastronomic/img_8382.jpg\" alt=\"img_8382\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quesomenterochaplincafenovembregastronomic/img_8383.jpg\" alt=\"img_8383\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quesomenterochaplincafenovembregastronomic/img_8384.jpg\" alt=\"img_8384\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quesomenterochaplincafenovembregastronomic/img_8385.jpg\" alt=\"img_8385\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quesomenterochaplincafenovembregastronomic/img_8386.jpg\" alt=\"img_8386\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quesomenterochaplincafenovembregastronomic/img_8388.jpg\" alt=\"img_8388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/